OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fand occasionally heavy showers in the
OL,7,Fevening, becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fisolated overnight with some clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. Strong westerly
OL,10,Fwinds in the evening will start to
OL,11,Fease overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fa few showers. Breezy to start but
OL,15,Fwinds becoming light through the day.
OL,16,FSome patchy rain may spread north
OL,17,Flater in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
