OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith rain on Sunday morning and again
OL,7,Flater in the day. Bright start Monday
OL,8,Fthen increasingly heavy showers and
OL,9,Fstrong winds. Windy Tuesday with
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
